    "ko": "对朋友常用“……吧？”表示商量。",
    "en": "With friends 吧 invites agreement."
   },
   {
    "ko": "约定见面用“在 + 地点 + 时间 + 见”。",
    "en": "Arrange meetings with 在 + place + time + 见."
   }
  ],
